#
# LF in the repository for every text file. `dotnet new` emits CRLF for some of its
# templates and LF for others, which is how the first four scaffolded files ended up
# disagreeing with every hand-written one — and it shows up as a whole-file diff the
# first time anybody edits one of them, hiding the actual change.
#
# eol=lf rather than eol=native: the shell scripts in openbao/ are bind-mounted
# straight into Linux containers, where a CRLF shebang line is a runtime failure.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
